\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:2:  \"J6g Workload W harness and peer cross-host integration (BRIEF-j6g.md).\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:3:   Pre-registered criterion (v3 Section 2 A1, amended by v3.1 D4):\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:8:   whole of A's transfer and >= 60 s (>= 600 overlapping round trips; fewer than\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:10:   Criterion: during A's transfer, B's round-trip p99 <= 250 ms, no reply lost;\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:13:   Deliverable 1: The workload W harness and sampler.\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:210:   - Criterion: p99 <= 250 ms, no reply lost, A delivered once, REPL step advances every round.\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:214:      :or {target-duration-ms 60000 target-samples 600}}]\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:216:  (println \"J6g Workload W: Starting benchmark (target duration:\" target-duration-ms\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:295:                                    (println \"W-SAMPLE\" (- now sent-at))\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:498:                p99-ok? (and (some? p99) (<= p99 250))\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:525:                     (str \"(criterion <= 250 ms: \" p99-ok? \")\"))\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:576:  (println \"J6g Cross-Host Rows: Running checks...\")\nsrc/dev/jolt_workload_w.clj:769:  (println \"J6g Served-Stream Rejoin: Running 4 served-stream peer facts...\")\ndocs/design/dao.stream.ws.md:166:bounded handoff medium and acknowledgement.\ndocs/design/dao.stream.ws.md:187:server writer capabilities travel through bounded handoff slots, never through\ndocs/design/dao.stream.ws.md:208:the bounded pending connection associated with each configured handoff slot.\ndocs/design/dao.stream.ws.md:225:**Acceptance is a bounded, acknowledged stream handoff.** At endpoint\ndocs/design/dao.stream.ws.md:243:identity and handle, retains the connection in the endpoint's bounded\ndocs/design/dao.stream.ws.md:305:The handoff remains bounded. When no slot is free, the transport admits no\ndocs/design/dao.stream.ws.